WEBVTT

00:27.940 --> 00:29.820
The war is already over.

00:31.530 --> 00:34.450
But it's even worse now.

00:34.820 --> 00:35.740
Worse?

00:37.030 --> 00:39.870
Because of the war, Daddy and Mommy...

00:40.540 --> 00:41.710
I see.

00:44.170 --> 00:45.790
Where will you go now?

00:46.590 --> 00:50.460
We don't know. Anywhere but here.

00:55.430 --> 00:57.470
What are you?

00:59.720 --> 01:02.230
As you can see, I'm a Penguin.

01:06.190 --> 01:07.610
Where did you come from?

01:08.150 --> 01:09.900
Somewhere far away.

01:10.940 --> 01:15.070
Unable to find my way back, I've been wandering for many years.

01:15.570 --> 01:16.820
You're lost?

01:17.570 --> 01:19.330
That's about right.

01:19.830 --> 01:22.660
Then you're all alone, too.

01:23.250 --> 01:24.830
That's about right.

01:28.130 --> 01:29.630
Why are you following me?

01:30.550 --> 01:32.010
Because of loneliness.

01:32.630 --> 01:36.640
Are you talking about yourself? Or are you talking about me?

01:39.050 --> 01:40.720
You can decide.

01:42.060 --> 01:44.770
Then, I believe we're both lonely.

01:46.900 --> 01:49.980
You're kind. Even though you're just a Penguin.

01:50.570 --> 01:53.820
Incorrect. It's because I am a Penguin.

01:54.860 --> 01:58.660
We see, Penguins are kind.

02:01.450 --> 02:02.950
Amazing!

02:03.540 --> 02:05.830
This is a piece of cake for me.

02:06.370 --> 02:09.080
I am a Penguin, after all.

02:22.220 --> 02:23.140
A town!

02:24.140 --> 02:29.860
A human town. Even in a parallel world it looks the same.

02:30.480 --> 02:31.900
Parallel?

02:32.480 --> 02:34.030
This is where we part ways.

02:34.030 --> 02:34.690
Huh?

02:35.860 --> 02:40.570
It is still not the time to show myself in front of many humans.

02:41.070 --> 02:43.410
But we only just started getting along...

02:44.160 --> 02:45.660
Getting along...

02:46.910 --> 02:49.210
Well, it was a good experience.

02:50.000 --> 02:51.130
Thank you.

02:53.170 --> 02:58.050
I left my family behind when I came here.

02:58.970 --> 03:00.640
I have to return to them.

03:01.010 --> 03:04.890
And there is something I must accomplish for that to happen.

03:05.850 --> 03:09.310
Then, we'll become a Penguin, too!

03:09.850 --> 03:13.060
You have to find your own family.

03:13.650 --> 03:16.400
I'm sure you'll find comrades if you go down there.

03:20.660 --> 03:23.910
I've been collecting money to accomplish my goal.

03:24.740 --> 03:27.000
This isn't much,

03:27.000 --> 03:29.210
but it should be enough to help you live for a while.

03:29.210 --> 03:30.420
Live?

03:30.830 --> 03:36.050
That's right. Be strong and live. You can manage it.

03:37.760 --> 03:39.130
Will we meet again?

03:40.010 --> 03:45.010
Perhaps, someday. Goodbye, young human.

03:50.640 --> 03:56.900
We'll definitely... We'll definitely see you again, Penguin-san!

04:00.610 --> 04:01.610
A dream?

04:02.860 --> 04:07.790
We don't really remember, but it felt like a really nostalgic dream.

04:07.790 --> 04:09.790
It looks like you were sleeping soundly.

04:10.790 --> 04:12.710
Why are you in our bed, Jim?!

04:12.710 --> 04:14.380
No, everyone's here.

04:14.380 --> 04:15.960
Hey, good morning Ritz.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.800
How about some coffee at the break of dawn?

04:17.800 --> 04:20.130
So that's why we felt so constrained sleeping.

04:20.340 --> 04:25.680
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

04:25.300 --> 04:31.230
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

04:38.650 --> 04:44.320
The darkness is spreading

04:43.990 --> 04:49.740
Why do I keep fighting?

04:49.290 --> 05:00.260
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

04:59.960 --> 05:05.760
The sound of moaning gives me power

05:05.220 --> 05:08.350
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

05:13.230 --> 05:18.980
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

05:18.690 --> 05:24.400
Attack when fully charged

05:50.510 --> 05:55.310
Episode 09  :

05:50.510 --> 05:55.310
Warning ! The Closed Gate

05:59.110 --> 06:02.190
The Penguin Empire has fallen far.

06:02.610 --> 06:07.030
To be defeated by the humans even though we, the strongest five,

06:07.030 --> 06:11.870
are by your side. Forgive us, Penguin Emperor.

06:12.540 --> 06:13.830
Don't say that, Adelie!

06:14.250 --> 06:18.210
Though our penguin plans have been foiled, we will plan anew!

06:18.210 --> 06:20.710
Your Highness! Please take a look at this!

06:22.380 --> 06:27.090
Such high quality Hi-ERO particles? And so much?!

06:27.090 --> 06:30.970
It looks like a nest of concentrated Hi-ERO particles.

06:31.260 --> 06:34.350
But I know of no place like this.

06:34.350 --> 06:36.100
It is Earth, in a different dimension.

06:36.480 --> 06:42.270
I accidentally connected when I was preparing to sell the Device.

06:42.270 --> 06:44.440
You were selling the empire's belongings?!

06:44.440 --> 06:46.110
I'm very sorry!

06:46.110 --> 06:48.820
But we've reached the point where we can't even feed the Commanders...

06:49.200 --> 06:50.780
Well, it's fine.

06:50.780 --> 06:52.780
For the Penguin Empire, we will create a transportation Device

06:52.780 --> 06:56.120
that will allow us to jump between parallel worlds!

06:58.370 --> 07:00.880
Penguin Dimensional Transportation Device,

07:01.210 --> 07:04.300
nicknamed the "Penguin Device" experimental version!

07:06.880 --> 07:09.300
A malfunction?! This is bad.

07:09.300 --> 07:11.720
If I break this, Macaroni and the others will be angry with me.

07:13.560 --> 07:14.390
This is...

07:16.060 --> 07:16.770
...bad!

07:22.310 --> 07:26.400
This is bad! The path to go back has been closed off.

07:28.150 --> 07:29.320
In that case...

07:29.570 --> 07:35.200
I will make a new Penguin Empire in this world!

07:39.210 --> 07:43.420
Due to the abundance of Hi-ERO particles in this world,

07:43.420 --> 07:47.460
the Penguin Commandos that I created matured quickly.

07:48.210 --> 07:52.050
A fully functional Penguin Device is also nearing completion.

07:53.850 --> 07:57.850
Come to think of it... when I was wandering this world,

07:57.850 --> 08:00.600
I came across a young human.

08:02.060 --> 08:03.980
Since I do not have a Lolita complex,

08:03.980 --> 08:06.360
I don't remember her face well.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.690
I hope she is doing well...

08:10.150 --> 08:11.570
Then, I shall tell you!

08:11.570 --> 08:14.410
Operation New Penguin!

08:15.740 --> 08:19.330
What could Operation New Penguin be?

08:19.330 --> 08:20.660
I don't know.

08:21.120 --> 08:25.960
But he announced it grandly, so it must be something huge.

08:26.960 --> 08:29.760
If only Madanbashi were here...

08:30.050 --> 08:34.590
Another Factor like me. He piloted Daimidaler Type-2...

08:35.140 --> 08:38.600
Where is that Madanbashi guy now?

08:39.970 --> 08:45.310
Madanbashi self-destructed with the Penguin robot in West Shinjuku.

08:45.310 --> 08:48.230
The great explosion of West Shinjuku...

08:48.690 --> 08:52.240
The extreme temperature of the explosion disintegrated everything.

08:52.860 --> 08:53.740
The only things he left behind

08:54.240 --> 08:55.320
...were his left arm...

08:58.490 --> 09:00.120
and his girl.

09:01.540 --> 09:04.040
It'll be fine, Administrator Matayoshi.

09:04.420 --> 09:05.290
Hey!

09:09.960 --> 09:13.220
Please look at the strength of these Hi-ERO particles.

09:13.720 --> 09:17.100
There is no way that the Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko,

09:17.100 --> 09:18.930
that we pilot would ever lose.

09:19.810 --> 09:21.220
That's right.

09:21.850 --> 09:25.310
I'm sorry, I should place more trust in you two.

09:28.270 --> 09:30.440
So annoying!

09:31.320 --> 09:34.150
The Super Antarctic that we transferred won't move?

09:34.150 --> 09:37.200
It won't power up at all. We're at a loss.

09:39.280 --> 09:40.950
For the sake of this operation,

09:40.950 --> 09:46.420
we can't let the Super Antarctic that Humboldt transferred go to waste.

09:46.710 --> 09:49.170
Your Highness, who is Humboldt?

09:49.170 --> 09:54.170
She was one of the strongest five of the Penguin Empire in my old world.

09:54.590 --> 09:57.300
Within the group, she was second.

09:57.680 --> 10:00.680
A master of the Penguin Empire-style martial arts.

10:00.680 --> 10:06.140
Could that be a dainty golden haired beauty that looks like Ritz?

10:06.140 --> 10:07.480
That's right.

10:07.480 --> 10:09.360
The one who's standing right there?

10:11.070 --> 10:12.820
Wow, what a wonderful front tail!

10:12.820 --> 10:14.440
Oh, you are embarrassing me.

10:14.440 --> 10:17.990
It's larger than any of the Penguin commanders where I'm from.

10:17.990 --> 10:21.990
What are Penguin Commanders? We're Penguin Commandos.

10:21.990 --> 10:23.490
Humboldt!

10:23.490 --> 10:26.330
She was unconscious in the robot that transferred over.

10:26.330 --> 10:31.000
I discovered after pulling her out that her bust was a meager 70 centimeters.

10:31.250 --> 10:33.000
Your Highness is a liar!

10:33.000 --> 10:34.590
When we came here,

10:34.590 --> 10:38.010
you said that humans couldn't be a part of the Penguin Empire!

10:38.010 --> 10:40.550
No, she isn't human.

10:40.550 --> 10:41.220
Huh?

10:41.760 --> 10:45.520
She was artificially created using Humboldt Penguins as a base.

10:45.520 --> 10:46.980
She's a Penguin-san?

10:46.980 --> 10:51.440
Only, she was created during the Humboldt Penguin mating season.

10:52.650 --> 10:54.150
Do whatever you want to me!

10:54.150 --> 10:55.440
My god!

10:56.240 --> 10:58.150
She is very lecherous.

10:59.450 --> 11:01.450
Oh, Your Highness!

11:01.870 --> 11:03.950
As healthy as ever.

11:03.950 --> 11:07.040
As your subject, I'm very happy to see you as such!

11:07.040 --> 11:09.960
For now, cover those small breasts!

11:12.540 --> 11:16.880
I was accidentally transferred during the last system checks.

11:16.880 --> 11:20.590
When I regained consciousness, my chest was being measured.

11:20.590 --> 11:23.220
I'm sorry about that, Humboldt.

11:24.010 --> 11:27.850
Well, it's convenient that you are here as well.

11:27.850 --> 11:28.480
Huh?

11:29.140 --> 11:30.480
Actually...

11:31.810 --> 11:33.360
After some examination,

11:33.360 --> 11:36.360
it seems that the Penguin line to move the Super Antarctic

11:36.360 --> 11:38.950
is too weak in this world.

11:39.610 --> 11:42.240
But, don't fret, Your Highness!

11:42.240 --> 11:46.740
I'm sure the output of my Penguin line would fill that gap.

11:48.000 --> 11:50.540
Are you saying that you will pilot it yourself?!

11:50.830 --> 11:52.040
Leave it to me!

11:55.960 --> 11:57.550
What's wrong, Humboldt?

11:58.420 --> 11:59.220
Huh?

11:59.590 --> 12:03.590
What! You forgot how to pilot it?!

12:03.590 --> 12:06.510
For some reason, I can't remember at all!

12:06.510 --> 12:07.770
Oh, I see.

12:07.770 --> 12:09.930
It must be a side effect from the Penguin Device.

12:10.810 --> 12:12.350
Of all things...

12:13.520 --> 12:14.770
So frustrating!

12:14.770 --> 12:18.360
We would pilot the Super Antarctic if it moved!

12:18.360 --> 12:19.400
That's it!

12:20.400 --> 12:23.570
If we use the generators that the humans created from our technology,

12:23.570 --> 12:26.490
we might be able to fill the gap in the Penguin line.

12:26.490 --> 12:29.160
I see! Good job, Dennis!

12:29.160 --> 12:30.660
Oh, stop!

12:30.660 --> 12:32.750
No! That thing is dangerous!

12:32.750 --> 12:35.290
Ritz may go berserk again!

12:36.590 --> 12:38.460
We'll be fine this time!

12:38.460 --> 12:40.260
But...

12:40.260 --> 12:41.630
Generators...

12:43.010 --> 12:47.760
Robots like that appeared recently in our world as well.

12:48.720 --> 12:52.810
Robots using Hi-ERO particle generators appeared in the other world?

12:52.810 --> 12:54.690
But they weren't useful,

12:54.690 --> 12:58.440
so they were changed to thermal power systems by necessity.

12:58.780 --> 13:00.940
To begin with, is it possible

13:00.940 --> 13:04.740
to install a Hi-ERO particle generator on the Super Antarctic?

13:04.740 --> 13:06.660
It's not impossible,

13:06.660 --> 13:09.870
but I believe it would take a lot of money and labor.

13:10.700 --> 13:13.290
Your Highness, leave it to us.

13:13.540 --> 13:15.040
Do you have an idea?

13:15.040 --> 13:19.250
We can sell our porno magazine collection for the funds.

13:19.250 --> 13:21.460
And, for labor,

13:21.460 --> 13:24.840
we'll pull all-nighters without overtime until it's complete!

13:24.840 --> 13:26.050
Hold on a moment!

13:26.050 --> 13:29.680
The Penguin Empire is a country kind to its citizens.

13:29.680 --> 13:32.020
I cannot allow such sweatshop-like conditions!

13:32.020 --> 13:33.640
It is all for Ritz's sake.

13:33.640 --> 13:35.600
That's right! For Ritz!

13:35.850 --> 13:39.020
Morning Ritzness! Morning Ritzness!

13:39.020 --> 13:41.070
All right! If all of you want to go that far,

13:41.320 --> 13:44.860
let the Penguin Empire do everything in its power!

13:47.910 --> 13:49.990
E-Everyone!

13:53.790 --> 13:55.290
Morning Ritzness!

14:00.890 --> 14:01.210
Special Signed
Polaroid Included!

14:00.890 --> 14:01.210
Special
Appendix
Extra Large
Poster!!

14:00.890 --> 14:01.300
Idol of the Year

14:00.890 --> 14:01.300
Extremely
Large Poster!

14:00.920 --> 14:01.300
a

14:01.560 --> 14:01.900
Cute
Idol Off
Shots!

14:06.680 --> 14:09.970
Farewell, porno magazines. My bosom buddies!

14:10.260 --> 14:14.640
Hold back your tears, Jim. Someday, we'll buy them back.

14:14.640 --> 14:18.860
That's right, this is for the Penguin Empire. For Ritz.

14:20.400 --> 14:22.610
Everyone... for <i>us...</i>

14:22.610 --> 14:24.400
There's no time for tears.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.490
Rikantz Seaberry.

14:27.660 --> 14:30.660
The Penguin Path

14:27.860 --> 14:29.780
Now, attack me!

14:40.040 --> 14:43.420
Pretty good. But... not good enough!

14:44.880 --> 14:46.880
Embarrassment Hold!

14:47.090 --> 14:48.380
No!

14:48.380 --> 14:52.140
Oh, it looks like the look-alikes are doing something perverted!

14:52.350 --> 14:54.560
Training in the martial arts.

14:54.810 --> 14:58.270
It seems Humboldt-sama is the more skillful one.

14:58.270 --> 15:02.150
But Ritz's breasts are overwhelmingly bigger.

15:02.150 --> 15:03.730
No!

15:04.230 --> 15:07.780
Yes, there's no contest between an A-cup and a D-cup.

15:07.950 --> 15:10.700
We can't just ignore this show and pursue our work.

15:10.700 --> 15:13.780
Yes, we have to see it to the end!

15:15.160 --> 15:16.410
Fiery Blast!

15:16.580 --> 15:17.080
Huh?

15:17.370 --> 15:20.000
Penguin Thrust!

15:30.760 --> 15:31.840
Just now...

15:32.220 --> 15:34.100
Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust.

15:34.390 --> 15:37.350
Splitting the Earth and Sky, cutting through the crotch.

15:37.770 --> 15:42.770
A rigid attack only the strong can obtain in the Penguin Empire.

15:43.400 --> 15:44.980
Penguin Thrust...

15:45.360 --> 15:48.280
If you aim to join the Penguin elite,

15:48.280 --> 15:50.860
you must master the Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust!

15:52.280 --> 15:54.660
Yes, Master Humboldt!

16:02.000 --> 16:05.340
Morning Ritzness! Morning Ritzness! Morning Ritzness! Morning Ritzness!

16:08.210 --> 16:11.630
Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust!

16:13.550 --> 16:15.640
We finally did it.

16:15.640 --> 16:18.720
Yeah. The sun has already gone down.

16:19.230 --> 16:20.770
It is complete.

16:20.770 --> 16:21.640
Yes.

16:21.980 --> 16:24.190
I don't know how much remodeling was done,

16:24.400 --> 16:27.440
but it just looks like Antarctic Number 8 to me.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.360
Of course.

16:29.030 --> 16:31.820
We put Super Antarctic's parts and technology into

16:31.820 --> 16:34.700
the body of Antarctic Number 8, Ritz Custom.

16:34.910 --> 16:39.370
I see. I don't really understand, but I can accept it.

16:39.370 --> 16:42.120
We like this better because it looks more Penguin-like!

16:45.000 --> 16:46.630
Then, Your Highness,

16:46.960 --> 16:51.760
I will take my leave. I pray for your victory back in our world.

16:52.090 --> 16:54.090
Good work, Humboldt.

16:54.090 --> 16:56.890
Thank you very much, Master Humboldt!

16:57.180 --> 17:02.390
We will use what you taught us and definitely defeat Daimidaler!

17:08.820 --> 17:09.820
See you.

17:11.690 --> 17:13.320
This time, only her clothes.

17:13.320 --> 17:16.990
Humboldt-sama was bra-less under her clothes if I remember correctly.

17:16.990 --> 17:18.700
So, in other words...

17:18.910 --> 17:20.000
Just panties!

17:20.000 --> 17:21.080
Just panties!

17:21.200 --> 17:24.830
Just panties! Just panties! Woo! Woo! Just panties! Just panties!

17:24.040 --> 17:26.210
Just hurry up and prepare for attack!

17:26.420 --> 17:28.540
The target has passed the third line.

17:28.540 --> 17:30.420
It will arrive in the city within a few minutes.

17:30.630 --> 17:35.130
Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko, ejecting through Route 32, Gobanzeme.

17:39.430 --> 17:40.850
Here it comes, Kiriko-chan!

17:40.850 --> 17:42.520
Roger, Shouma-kun!

17:52.650 --> 17:56.570
Penguin robot. Isn't this a Type-A Plus?

17:56.820 --> 17:59.580
The same type of terrifying robot

17:59.580 --> 18:00.990
that destroyed Daimidaler Type-2, Kouichi.

18:01.120 --> 18:03.910
But that was just because it went berserk and self-destructed.

18:03.910 --> 18:06.000
Why are they using such an old model at a time like this?

18:06.500 --> 18:08.380
I don't know the reasoning,

18:08.670 --> 18:11.630
but we need to put an end to this immediately!

18:12.000 --> 18:15.670
Kiyuna Kiriko. Ameku Shouma. Our strength is greater.

18:15.670 --> 18:16.880
Swat it down!

18:16.880 --> 18:19.260
The Administrator is a pretty calculating man.

18:19.510 --> 18:23.270
Why have you appeared in such a dated robot model,

18:23.560 --> 18:25.060
Rikantz Seaberry?!

18:25.270 --> 18:29.610
Non non! Don't be so formal. Just call us Ritz!

18:30.060 --> 18:31.520
Answer my question!

18:31.520 --> 18:35.780
Who cares? We love the Antarctic Number 8.

18:35.780 --> 18:38.530
Plus, I need to give you a handicap to be fair.

18:38.820 --> 18:43.490
I have always disliked that haughty attitude of yours!

18:43.490 --> 18:45.790
Prepare yourself, Rikantz Seaberry!

18:46.080 --> 18:48.790
We will definitely put a stop to your plans

18:48.870 --> 18:51.340
with this Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko!

18:51.790 --> 18:56.300
Let's go! Number 8, Ritz Custom 2!

18:57.130 --> 19:00.760
I'm sure Ritz will do well this time.

19:01.350 --> 19:05.180
But, is combining a human-made Hi-ERO particle generator

19:05.430 --> 19:10.690
with a weapon transferred from the other world really all right?

19:12.860 --> 19:14.570
The power levels are too different.

19:14.730 --> 19:16.320
An old model is still an old model.

19:16.490 --> 19:20.410
There! Push it down and make it so it can never marry!

19:20.410 --> 19:22.490
What kind of fight is that? Goodness.

19:22.990 --> 19:23.990
No problem!

19:24.490 --> 19:28.620
Special Attack! Cock-a-Doodle-Doo Attack!

19:34.130 --> 19:35.000
Kiriko-chan!

19:35.800 --> 19:36.760
Shouma-kun!

19:43.260 --> 19:44.390
What?!

20:04.740 --> 20:05.370
Complete!

20:05.910 --> 20:07.790
Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko!

20:07.790 --> 20:09.250
Disguise!

20:09.540 --> 20:10.370
Wha—!

20:10.370 --> 20:11.040
Ritz!

20:11.250 --> 20:16.880
Right now, we're ten times stronger than you!

20:22.680 --> 20:23.300
Now!

20:23.550 --> 20:24.300
Right!

20:30.140 --> 20:31.270
Daimidaler!

20:32.940 --> 20:35.520
GP Slash!

20:37.820 --> 20:39.110
We got it!

20:40.280 --> 20:42.610
Strong as expected, Daimidaler.

20:43.070 --> 20:44.110
However,...

20:44.280 --> 20:45.700
This is where it begins!

20:45.700 --> 20:46.700
What?

20:46.700 --> 20:48.740
Embarrassment Hold!

20:49.370 --> 20:50.870
No!

20:50.870 --> 20:53.290
Don't be fooled, Kiyuna Kiriko!

20:53.290 --> 20:55.880
It's not your legs that are spread open!

20:57.130 --> 20:58.880
Then, here we go!

21:02.930 --> 21:04.640
What is she planning on doing?

21:05.180 --> 21:06.640
She can't mean...

21:07.390 --> 21:08.640
Are you planning on self-destructing?!

21:08.850 --> 21:11.890
Unfortunately for you, we would do no such thing.

21:12.430 --> 21:17.400
We will survive until this world is a Penguin-filled utopia!

21:17.570 --> 21:19.280
Be strong and live.

21:20.990 --> 21:22.700
We won't die!

21:23.070 --> 21:24.110
No matter what!

21:26.370 --> 21:29.120
Out here we won't damage the city.

21:29.950 --> 21:30.830
Look!

21:31.200 --> 21:34.540
Feast your eyes upon our new strength!

21:36.920 --> 21:38.670
Hi-ERO particles...

21:49.470 --> 21:51.100
Kouichi-kun...

21:58.560 --> 21:59.690
Leave it to us

21:59.150 --> 22:01.150
Love love li-li-links

22:00.730 --> 22:01.900
Yes!

22:02.030 --> 22:03.780
Prince

22:16.750 --> 22:21.380
Don't worry about the force of the stars

22:21.130 --> 22:25.630
Let's let our power out

22:25.420 --> 22:30.010
It's best to think about who it is that you want to meet

22:29.760 --> 22:33.810
When you want to meet someone

22:33.770 --> 22:36.520
Preparation okay!

22:35.980 --> 22:38.310
Let's go then!

22:38.100 --> 22:40.810
It'll work out somehow

22:40.270 --> 22:42.610
Let's go with that!

22:42.570 --> 22:46.780
When we have something amazing

22:46.740 --> 22:49.530
Our dreams are one, two, infinite

22:49.160 --> 22:51.370
Let's go, everyone

22:50.490 --> 22:51.620
Yes!

22:51.080 --> 22:55.580
Let's make our own happiness

22:55.410 --> 22:59.750
Because if you only wait for happiness to come to you

22:59.460 --> 23:04.340
You'll never be able to have it

23:04.340 --> 23:08.590
For a happy future, you have to be determined

23:08.340 --> 23:09.930
Love love link

23:09.430 --> 23:11.050
I want to be a bride

23:10.550 --> 23:12.220
Leave it to me

23:11.890 --> 23:15.770
Let's have fun around the world

23:16.640 --> 23:18.230
Oh!

23:17.520 --> 23:18.230
Yay!

23:27.440 --> 23:42.790
Next Episode

23:28.900 --> 23:30.860
Superiority is just a fantasy.

23:31.620 --> 23:34.910
If you think that way, you can live tomorrow as well.

23:36.200 --> 23:40.210
Next Episode: "Invoke! Joseph's Symbol"

23:37.500 --> 23:42.790
Invoke !Joseph's Symbol

23:40.210 --> 23:41.460
Please look forward to it.

23:40.370 --> 23:42.790
Please watch.
